        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI AP-SIG405, Contemporary Stainless Steel Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ladder style appliance pull is available in 14 inch, 24 inch, 36 inch, and 48 inch lengths. No matter which length you choose, the diameter will be 1-1/4 inches. Made from stainless steel, it is suitable for use on even heavy-duty vacuum seal refrigerators. The Contemporary Stainless Steel Appliance Handle has a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI AP-SIG405 Contemporary Appliance / Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" (19 mm) thick refrigerator / appliance door panel.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG405-specifications.pdf?v=1691093353\"><b>AHI AP-SIG405 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AHI-AP-SIG405-355:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AHI-AP-SIG405-610:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount:14\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AHI-AP-SIG405-914:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AHI-AP-SIG405-1220:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</1>\r\n</p>",
